## how i approach testing

mostly stress testing, breaking

- checking normal user flows
- throwing invalid inputs at everything
- testing unusual combinations and edge cases
- reproducing bugs and figuring out what caused them
- checking whether fixes actually work
- making sure yesterday's fix didn't break something completely unrelated

